全球设备 #供应链 整体紧张，交付周期拉长，部分设备交付时间仍存在不确定性，虽不会影响今年的扩产规划落地，但可能对全年的资本开支执行带来扰动。","tg":{"views":2360,"views_label":"2.36K","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T00:07:01+08:00"}},{"id":"FinanceNewsDaily:496582","kind":"news","channel":"finance","source_id":"FinanceNewsDaily","source_name":"华尔街见闻·财经时讯","title":"#台湾 证交所加权股价指数上涨3%至44,388.11点。","summary":"","url":"https://t.me/FinanceNewsDaily/496582","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-13T09:25:07+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T08:12:02+08:00","lang":"zh","translated":false,"body":"#台湾 证交所加权股价指数上涨3%至44,388.11点。","tg":{"views":2230,"views_label":"2.23K","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T00:07:01+08:00"}},{"id":"FinanceNewsDaily:496581","kind":"news","channel":"finance","source_id":"FinanceNewsDaily","source_name":"华尔街见闻·财经时讯","title":"#习近平 将出席亚太经合组织第三十三次领导人非正式会议及相关活动。（ #新华社 ）","summary":"","url":"https://t.me/FinanceNewsDaily/496581","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-13T09:05:04+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T08:12:02+08:00","lang":"zh","translated":false,"body":"#习近平 将出席亚太经合组织第三十三次领导人非正式会议及相关活动。（ #新华社 ）","tg":{"views":2250,"views_label":"2.25K","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T00:07:01+08:00"}}]}